      en: ["The bridge currently measures approximately 204 meters in length.", "The Water Tower was constructed around 1300, before the bridge.", "There were originally 158 triangular paintings under the roof.", "86 of the historical paintings were destroyed in the 1993 fire.", "The bridge was reopened on April 14, 1994, after reconstruction.", "The octagonal tower is 34 meters high and has very thick walls."],
