      en: ["The opera house was officially opened on October 1, 1891.", "The facade features busts of famous composers and poets, including Mozart and Wagner.", "The venue has a total seating capacity of 1,100 seats.", "In 2014, Zurich Opera House was named 'Opera House of the Year.'", "Around 1,300 people are employed in the operation of the house.", "Construction began with the laying of the foundation stone on May 2, 1890."],
