      en: ["Portions of the building date back to the 14th and 15th centuries.", "The Town Hall Arch is a famous landmark in the old town of Schaffhausen.", "The Council Chamber features wood carvings dating from 1591.", "The complex has undergone multiple expansions over the centuries.", "It is located in the heart of Schaffhausen's pedestrian zone.", "The Stadthaus also houses the official city archives of Schaffhausen."],
